stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CachedView
  CachedView --> CheckingSession: History restores the page; hide cached controls
  CheckingSession --> CheckingSession: An older check finishes; keep cached controls hidden
  CheckingSession --> VerifiedView: A fresh check confirms the same session
  CheckingSession --> SessionEnded: A fresh check finds a changed or denied session
  CheckingSession --> PausedView: Verification is unavailable or the read budget refuses it
  PausedView --> CheckingSession: Allowed user interaction resumes verification
